I try to keep a few wands of teleport (great for breaking), and a 
few cursed scrolls of genocide (building jelly walls).  Be 
careful of ranged attacks.  /oDeath can be helpful in that 
regards.

Want of fire can be useful, but a lot less things respect elbereth 
on the planes.

Wand of digging can be nice for escaping air elementals.

Holy water or blessed scrolls of taming is very useful.  Food for 
dealing with famine's attacks as well.

I prefer a few blessed potions of full healing.

Some guaranteed way of curing sickness.  Holy/unholy water works well,
depending on alignment/race.

Some way to locate the portal.

Scrolls of taming (while confused) and magic whistles are fun, 
but its more of a stupid pet trick than anything useful.

I like to carry a few scrolls of charging as well.

